  "//overrides": "app/ has no lockfile, so Vercel's `npm install` floats these ^ ranges to versions newer than the last clean deploy (86be4c11). @sentry/nextjs auto-instruments middleware.ts and @upstash/* is imported by it directly; newer versions drag Node-only code into the Edge middleware bundle -> Vercel 'referencing unsupported modules' deploy failure (mis-attributed to whatever userland file shares that chunk). Pin the entire middleware dep subtree to the exact versions in the tested root pnpm-lock.yaml. Regenerate/re-pin after any intentional bump of these.",
